26-10-11","zh":"投資者對 Jacobs Solutions 有何反應 (J) Nvidia AI 設施獲勝"},{"title":"Is Jacobs Solutions (J) Undervalued Following Its NVIDIA AI Facility Deal?","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"Jacobs Solutions (J) 收購 NVIDIA AI 設施後其估值是否被低估？"},{"title":"Jacobs Solutions (NYSE:J) Given New $160.00 Price Target at Truist Financial","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-05","zh":"Truist Financial 給予 Jacobs Solutions (NYSE:J) 新的 160.00 美元目標價"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-11-20","period":"2025-09-26","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000162828025053316/jec-20250926.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Guided by our values and our brand promise — Challenging today. Reinventing tomorrow – Jacobs delivers innovative solutions to address the world's most complex challenges and create lasting value for clients, communities and society.","zh":"以我們的價值觀和品牌承諾為指導——今天充滿挑戰。重塑明天——Jacobs 提供創新的解決方案來應對世界上最複雜的挑戰，並為客戶、社區和社會創造持久的價值。"},{"en":"With a global team of approximately 43,000, we provide end-to-end capabilities across advanced manufacturing, cities & places, energy, environmental, life sciences, transportation and water. Our services span advisory and consulting, feasibility and planning, through to design, program delivery and lifecycle management — helping to create a more connected and sustainable world.","zh":"我們擁有約 43,000 人的全球團隊，提供跨先進製造、城市和地區、能源、環境、生命科學、交通和水務的端到端能力。我們的服務涵蓋諮詢和諮詢、可行性和規劃，一直到設計、專案交付和生命週期管理——幫助創造一個更互聯和永續的世界。"},{"en":"From addressing water scarcity and aging infrastructure to access to life-saving therapies and cyber resilience, we combine creativity, agility and deep domain expertise to deliver outcomes that matter. Our integrated approach enables clients to meet urgent needs today while preparing for the opportunities of tomorrow.","zh":"從解決水資源短缺和基礎設施老化問題到獲得救生療法和網路彈性，我們將創造力、敏捷性和深厚的領域專業知識結合起來，以提供重要的成果。我們的綜合方法使客戶能夠滿足當今的緊急需求，同時為明天的機會做好準備。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Given the percentage of total revenue derived directly from the U.S. federal government, the loss of U.S. federal government agencies as customers could have a material adverse effect on the Company. In addition, any or all of our government contracts could be terminated, we could be suspended or debarred from all government contract work, or payment of our costs could be disallowed. For more information on risks relating to our government contracts, see Item 1A- Risk Factors.","zh":"考慮到直接來自美國聯邦政府的總收入的百分比，失去美國聯邦政府機構作為客戶可能會對公司產生重大不利影響。此外，我們的任何或全部政府合約都可能被終止，我們可能被暫停或禁止參與所有政府合約工作，或可能不允許支付我們的費用。有關與我們的政府合約相關的風險的更多資訊，請參閱第 1A 項 - 風險因素。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete with many companies across the world including technology, consulting and engineering firms. Typically, no single company or companies dominate the markets in which we provide services, and often we partner with our competitors or other companies to jointly pursue projects. AECOM, Tetra Tech, WSP, Arcadis, Bechtel, Arup, Endava, Exponent, Mott MacDonald, Stantec, Parsons, Accenture, Mace, AtkinsRealis, Altair, Montrose, Capgemini, Fluor, Deloitte, KPMG, PwC, Bain & Company and McKinsey & Company are some of our competitors. We compete based on the following factors, among others: technical capabilities, reputation for quality, price of services, safety record, availability of qualified personnel, and ability to timely perform work and contract terms.","zh":"我們與世界各地的許多公司競爭，包括技術、諮詢和工程公司。通常，沒有任何一家或多家公司主導我們提供服務的市場，我們通常與競爭對手或其他公司合作，共同進行專案。 AECOM、Tetra Tech、WSP、Arcadis、Bechtel、Arup、Endava、Exponent、Mott MacDonald、Stantec、Parsons、埃森哲、Mace、AtkinsRealis、Altair、Montrose、Capgemini、Fluor、德勤、畢馬威、普華永道、貝恩公司和麥肯錫公司是我們的一些競爭對手。我們根據以下因素進行競爭：技術能力、品質聲譽、服務價格、安全記錄、合格人員的可用性以及及時履行工作和合約條款的能力。"},{"en":"Our people and culture define Jacobs. Authentic leadership and a commitment to living our core values every day creates a culture of trust, respect and empowerment across our business — enabling us to deliver the best outcomes for all our stakeholders. Guided by our employee value statement, \"Jacobs. A world where you can.\", our strategy further connects our people to our purpose and helps us continuously evolve our culture to support, empower and enable our talent to thrive.","zh":"我們的人民和文化定義了雅各布斯。真誠的領導力和每天實踐我們核心價值的承諾，在我們的整個企業中創造了一種信任、尊重和賦權的文化，使我們能夠為所有利益相關者提供最佳成果。在我們的員工價值觀宣言「Jacobs。一個你可以的世界。」的指導下，我們的策略進一步將我們的員工與我們的目標聯繫起來，幫助我們不斷發展我們的文化，以支持、授權和幫助我們的人才蓬勃發展。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-09-26","items":[{"name":"Infrastructure Advanced Facilities","val":10764206000,"zh":"基礎設施 設施先進"},{"name":"PA Consulting","val":1265577000,"zh":"PA諮詢"}],"total":12029783000},"geo":{"end":"2025-09-26","items":[{"name":"US","val":7415464000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":2871566000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Middle Eastand Africa","val":596330000,"zh":"中東和非洲"},{"name":"Australiaand New Zealand","val":573237000,"zh":"澳洲和紐西蘭"},{"name":"CA","val":248118000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"IN","val":180124000,"zh":"印度"},{"name":"Asia","val":144944000,"zh":"亞洲"}],"total":12029783000}},"peers":["IEX","TT","FTV","ALLE","ACM"]}}